      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْكُودٌ</span></b>  A <i>small,</i> or <i>scanty, gift;</i> (A, L, K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنَكَّدٌ</span></b>  (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْكُودٌ</span> A man <i>having many
askers and giving little:</i> (TA:) or <i>a man pressed
with petitions;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْرُوكٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْفُوهٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْجُوزٌ</span>. (IAar, L.)

